# Copy to .env next to this file. .env is gitignored; never commit the token.
#
# GITHUB_TOKEN pushes the rebuilt page to evankoza/evankoza.github.io.
# Make it a fine-grained personal access token, scoped as narrowly as it goes:
#   Resource owner:     evankoza  (the PERSONAL account, not evan-koza)
#   Repository access:  Only select repositories -> evankoza.github.io
#   Permissions:        Repository permissions -> Contents -> Read and write
# Nothing else. It never touches wildfire-forecast, which is public and is only
# ever read.
GITHUB_TOKEN=

# Optional overrides; the defaults are what compose already passes.
# TZ=America/Toronto
# RUN_AT=03:17
